    {
      "id": "aqxv9upctnwlavyf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 954,
      "y": 288,
      "width": 344.96000000000004,
      "height": 210.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2038578867,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1197990395,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LinkService \u2014 app-to-app via IAS (azp):\n  register(bucket, nodeId) \u2192 docId\n  linkFor(docId) \u2192 /invoice/{token}  (24h)\n  linkForNode(bucket, nodeId)\nbucket ACLs: allowedWriters / allowedReaders\n  (writer \u21d2 reader, folder-guarded claim)\n\nGET /invoice/:token \u2014 anonymous,\n  the token IS the credential\n  verify HMAC \u2192 302 to CloudFront\nsigns CloudFront URLs \u2014 the key\n  never leaves this service",
      "originalText": "LinkService \u2014 app-to-app via IAS (azp):\n  register(bucket, nodeId) \u2192 docId\n  linkFor(docId) \u2192 /invoice/{token}  (24h)\n  linkForNode(bucket, nodeId)\nbucket ACLs: allowedWriters / allowedReaders\n  (writer \u21d2 reader, folder-guarded claim)\n\nGET /invoice/:token \u2014 anonymous,\n  the token IS the credential\n  verify HMAC \u2192 302 to CloudFront\nsigns CloudFront URLs \u2014 the key\n  never leaves this service",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 14
    },
