      "versionNonce": 436531841,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The flow (portal user opens an invoice):\n\u2460 concierge lists invoices / receipts\n\u2461 register(bucket, nodeId) \u2192 docId\n    (once, right after the plugin stores)\n\u2462 linkFor(docId) \u2192 /invoice/{token}\n\u2463 click \u2192 token verified \u2192 302\n\u2464 browser fetches from CloudFront\n\u2465\u2466 first read only: pull from\n    OpenText, write through to S3",
      "originalText": "The flow (portal user opens an invoice):\n\u2460 concierge lists invoices / receipts\n\u2461 register(bucket, nodeId) \u2192 docId\n    (once, right after the plugin stores)\n\u2462 linkFor(docId) \u2192 /invoice/{token}\n\u2463 click \u2192 token verified \u2192 302\n\u2464 browser fetches from CloudFront\n\u2465\u2466 first read only: pull from\n    OpenText, write through to S3",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
