      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deliberate: OpenText IS the DMS.\nBTP apps that need storage use\n@gpc/attachments-opentext.\nNo PDFs in HANA (C3); S3 is only\na 30-day cache.",
